{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"文档切片(Chunking)策略与最佳实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\n在 RAG 系统中，文档切片（Chunking）是关键的预处理步骤。有哪些常见的切片策略？各自的优缺点是什么？如何选择合适的切片参数？\n\n## 答案\n\n文档切片是 RAG 系统的关键环节，不合理的切片会导致**语义丢失**或**检索精度下降**。以下是常见策略：\n\n**1. 固定长度切片（Fixed-size Chunking）**\n\n```python\nfrom langchain_text_splitters import CharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter = CharacterTextSplitter(\n    chunk_size=1000,    # 每个 chunk 1000 字符\n    chunk_overlap=200   # 重叠 200 字符\n)\nchunks = splitter.split_documents(documents)\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：简单直接，实现容易</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：可能切断句子或段落，破坏语义完整性</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 递归字符切片（RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_text_splitters <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n\nsplitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    chunk_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">1000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    chunk_overlap<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    separators<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"！\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\" \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 按优先级尝试分隔符：段落 &gt; 句子 &gt; 空格 &gt; 字符</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nchunks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> splitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split_documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：优先保持段落/句子完整性，语义更连贯</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：chunk 大小可能不均匀</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用场景</strong>：通用文本处理，LangChain 推荐方案</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 语义切片（Semantic Chunking）</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">基于句子相似度进行切片，当相邻句子语义差异大时切分。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_experimental<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>text_splitter <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> SemanticChunker\n\nsplitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> SemanticChunker<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    embeddings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    breakpoint_threshold_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"percentile\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 或 \"standard_deviation\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nchunks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> splitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split_documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：按语义边界切分，检索质量更高</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：计算成本高，速度较慢</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>4. 结构感知切片（Structure-aware）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">按 Markdown/HTML 标题层级切分</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">按代码函数/类切分</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">按文档章节切分</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_text_splitters <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter\n\nsplitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    headers_to_split_on<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"#\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Header 1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"##\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Header 2\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nchunks <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> splitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>split_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>markdown_text<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>5. 父文档-子块策略（Parent-Document Retrieval）</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  父文档（完整文档或大段）                              │\n│  ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐             │\n│  │ 子块 1    │ │ 子块 2    │ │ 子块 3    │  ...      │\n│  │ (检索用)  │ │ (检索用)  │ │ (检索用)  │            │\n│  └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘             │\n│  检索时：用子块向量匹配                                │\n│  生成时：用父文档完整内容作为上下文                      │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>优点</strong>：检索精度高，生成时上下文完整</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>缺点</strong>：存储成本增加（需存父子两份数据）</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>参数选择建议：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>chunk_size</td>\n<td>256-1024 tokens</td>\n<td>太小则信息碎片化，太大则检索精度下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>chunk_overlap</td>\n<td>10%-20%</td>\n<td>保持跨 chunk 的上下文连续性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小 chunk</td>\n<td>50+ tokens</td>\n<td>避免过小的无意义 chunk</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>不同场景的推荐策略：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>通用文本</td>\n<td>递归字符切片</td>\n<td>平衡实现难度和效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码文档</td>\n<td>结构感知切片</td>\n<td>保持函数/类完整性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律/合同</td>\n<td>语义切片</td>\n<td>语义完整性要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超长文档</td>\n<td>父文档-子块策略</td>\n<td>兼顾检索精度和生成质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: chunk_size 应该设置多大？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 核心原则是<strong>不超过 Embedding 模型的最大输入长度</strong>和<strong>LLM 的上下文窗口</strong>的 1/4-1/3。一般经验值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">短文本问答：256-512 tokens</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">通用知识库：512-1000 tokens</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">长文档摘要：1000-2000 tokens</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 重叠(overlap)的作用是什么？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 重叠确保跨 chunk 的上下文不会断裂。例如一个完整的句子\"张三的年龄是25岁，他是北京分部的经理\"，如果不重叠，可能被切成\"张三的年龄是25岁\"和\"他是北京分部的经理\"，导致第二个 chunk 缺少主语。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>一刀切使用固定切片</strong> — 不同类型的文档应该用不同的切片策略</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>完全忽略重叠</strong> — 没有重叠会导致跨 chunk 语义断裂</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>chunk 越大越好</strong> — 过大的 chunk 会降低检索精度，噪声增多</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>不考虑下游 LLM 的上下文限制</strong> — chunk 数量 × chunk 大小不应超过 LLM 上下文窗口</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q4&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q4: Embedding 模型有哪些选择？如何根据场景选型？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q4: Embedding 模型有哪些选择？如何根据场景选型？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}